# Redirect all non-www traffic to www permanently
#
# NOTE: this rule is not what serves the apex redirect in production. The
# redirect is applied at the Cloudflare edge, ahead of this file. Changing the
# status code has to be done in the Cloudflare dashboard (Rules -> Redirect
# Rules); editing this line alone will not do it.
https://supplyministry.com.au/* https://www.supplyministry.com.au/:splat 301!

# NOTE: /sitemap.xml is deliberately NOT proxied here any more. Lovable static
# hosting does not process _redirects at all, so the Netlify-style `200!`
# force-proxy to the Supabase edge function never took effect on the custom
# domain and a stale six-URL response kept being served. The sitemap is now a
# real static file generated at build time by scripts/generate-sitemap.ts.
